        "operationId": "revertTechnicalGeoReportContent",
        "x-mcp-tool": "revert_technical_geo_report_content",
        "x-write": true,
        "description": "Discards every manual edit on the llms_txt report and restores the llms.txt and llms-full.txt files exactly as they were generated. Returns ERR_INVALID_PARAM when the report has no manual edits or report_type is not llms_txt. Requires a `read_write` scope API key and, for team members, create permission on GEO Optimization.",
